<title>POLAND: SOCCER-LEGIA WIN POLISH CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEGIA WIN POLISH CUP.</headline>
<dateline>LODZ, Poland 1997-06-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish Cup final result on Sunday: Legia Warszawa 2 GKS Katowice 0</p>
<p>Scorers: Sylwester Czereszewski 41, Tomasz Sokolowski 86.</p>
<p>Halftime 1-0. Attendance: 5,000</p>
